alwaysApply: true
---

Title: Documentation updates and man page generation

Scope:
- Applies to all changes that affect the `blitz` CLI behavior, flags, or configuration.
- Applies to man page source and generation.

Requirements:
- Any change to `blitz` command behavior or flags MUST update:
  - `docs/configuration.md`
  - `docs/metrics.md` (update metrics for new/changed components)
  - `docs/man/blitz.1.md`
- The source of truth for the man page is `docs/man/blitz.1.md`. Do not edit generated files.
- **README.md Components section**: All component entries (generators and outputs) MUST include links to their documentation using full GitHub URLs: `https://github.com/observiq/blitz/blob/main/docs/generator/<name>.md` or `https://github.com/observiq/blitz/blob/main/docs/output/<name>.md`
- **Configuration Documentation TOC**: The table of contents (TOC) in `docs/configuration.md` MUST be updated whenever configuration options, sections, or examples are added, removed, or renamed. The TOC must accurately reflect all sections and subsections in the document.
- **Shell Completion**: When adding or modifying flags with enum values (specific valid values), update `cmd/blitz/completion.go`:
  - Add or update completion functions in `registerFlagCompletions` for enum flags.
  - Use the flag name as created by `createFlagName` in `internal/config/override.go` (dots converted to hyphens, lowercased).
  - Provide all valid enum values as completion suggestions.
  - Use `cobra.ShellCompDirectiveNoFileComp` for enum flags to prevent file completion.
  - All flags are automatically included in completion; `registerFlagCompletions` only adds value suggestions for enum flags.

Man page generation:
- Generated files (`docs/man/blitz.1`, `docs/man/blitz.1.gz`) are not committed; they are reproducibly generated.
- Use:
  - `make man` to generate locally.
  - CI runs the generation to catch failures.
  - GoReleaser runs generation in `before.hooks` and packages `docs/man/blitz.1.gz` into Linux packages.
 - The generator injects the full contents of `docs/configuration.md` and `docs/metrics.md` into the man page output. Keep all documents up to date.

Tooling:
- New doc tooling must be added to `make install-tools` (not installed dynamically in scripts).
- The man generator script (`scripts/gen-man.sh`) may only check for required tools and fail if missing.

Acceptance checklist for CLI changes:
- [ ] `docs/configuration.md` updated for flags/behavior changes.
- [ ] Table of contents in `docs/configuration.md` updated to reflect any new, removed, or renamed sections.
- [ ] `docs/man/blitz.1.md` updated to reflect changes.
- [ ] **Shell completion updated**: If enum flags were added or modified, `cmd/blitz/completion.go` `registerFlagCompletions` function updated accordingly.
- [ ] `make man` succeeds locally.
- [ ] CI man generation step passes.
